==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has been downloaded an incredible 80 MILLION times worldwide! Celebrate with us during a special limited campaign event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between May 1st (11:00am) and May 29th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Celebration Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Get awesome rewards from daily Login Stamps!<br>
Earn one stamp each day when you visit the Cat Base menu in The Battle Cats! You can earn a {{Color|#FF0000|'''total of 4 Rare Tickets and Cat Tickets if you log in every single day during the event!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Special 80 Million Download Missions!'''}}<br>
New missions have been added to the Catnip Challenges in celebration of 80 million downloads! Clearing all 8 missions will earn you one {{Color|#FF0000|'''Platinum Shard'''}}!

※ 80 Million DL missions are only available until May 29th (10:59am). Be sure to tap the Claim button to receive your reward once the mission has been completed.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Special 80 Million Downloads Event Stages!'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages from The Battle Cats title menu and tap Start! to challenge special stages, available for a limited time only!

※ If event stages do not appear as scheduled, please make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent available version.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●80 Million Downloads Celebration Map!'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend/Event Stages to take on the limited map {{Color|#FF00FF|'''80M Celebration Gifts Galore!'''}} and earn {{Color|#FF0000|'''20 Cat Food'''}} upon clearing the stage! After your victory, the stage will disappear, but {{Color|#339966|'''the stage will reappear once again each day at 12:00am while the event is available!'''}}<br>
When the stage reappears, {{Color|#339966|'''all rewards will become available once again'''}}, allowing you to pick up another Cat Food reward every day! Clear the stage once every day to collect {{Color|#FF0000|'''a maximum of 580 Cat Food in total'''}}.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Deadly Carnival I, II, & III'''}}<br>
The toughest test is here... can you stand the heat?<br>
See if YOU are up to the challenge of these Deadly-grade stages! Clear the first stage for a reward of 3 Normal Tickets, then clear the second stage for a Rare Ticket prize!<br>
Don't miss out on this awesome chance for tickets!<br>
※Rewards will only be received upon the first stage clear. Players who have previously cleared Deadly Carnival I, Deadly Carnival II, or Deadly Carnival III will not be able to collect the rewards.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''・Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering'''}}<br>
A super challenge featuring the familiar faces of enemies from Monthly Event stages, gathered together for one tough map! Get a chance to earn up to 30,000,000 XP by clearing the stage!<br>
Topple these seasonal baddies and earn mountains of XP to power up your Cat Army!

※ After clearing a stage in a Gauntlet map, there will be a cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage in the series.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A during this cooldown period will allow you to immediately challenge the next Gauntlet stage without waiting.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Monthly All-Star Stages!'''}}<br>
Insane-difficulty Monthly All-Star Stages bring back all of the toughest bosses from the limited-edition Monthly Stages with big XP rewards!

{{Color|#0000FF|'''・Special Celebration'''}}<br>
May 1th (11:00am) thru May 5th (10:59am)<br>
