{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect building materials needed for a better Cat Base! Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during the times below to put your Cat Army to the test in the special stages {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings'''}}{{Color|#4285F4|''','''}} and {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Island of Ash!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～1:59pm / 6:00pm～7:59pm / 10:00pm～11:59pm'''}}<br>
Take on this challenge each day and stockpile building materials!

※These stages will become available once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.<br>
※ The Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings, and Island of Ash stages will appear at regularly scheduled times in addition to the special campaign times listed above.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festiva'''}}l, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#38761D|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#00BAFF|'''odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#00BAFF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''5/3, 5/6, 5/9, 5/12, 5/15, 5/18, 5/21, 5/24, 5/27!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#46BDC6|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・XP Harvest (4 areas)'''}}<br>
On between May 1st (11:00am) and May 15th (10:59am)!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
On between May 15th (11:00am) and May 29th (10:59am)!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

・Catseye Item Capsules<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between May 1st (11:00am) and May 15th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
・Catfruit Item Capsules<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between May 15th (11:00am) and May 29th (10:59am)!'''}}

